  "question": {
    "text": "A purse contains three <math><mn>10</mn></math> paise, three <math><mn>50</mn></math> paise and ten <math><mn>1</mn></math> rupee coins. If three coins are selected at random, then the probability that the total amount is <math><mn>2</mn></math> rupees is",
